-- INDEPENDENT TEST FILE for the Business Names Registration Act 2014.
-- Written from the statute (source/BNRA2014.txt) BEFORE reading the encoding's rules;
-- the encoding was read afterwards for names and signatures only.
-- A failing assertion here is a finding.  Do not edit an expected value to match the code.

§ `Fixtures: helpers that build records from a few flags`

-- ex2 m n: an Exemption Facts in which only the (up to two) numbered fields are TRUE.
-- 1 own full name; 2 firm full names; 3 profession; 4 regulations disapply (4(2));
-- 5 nominee/trustee (d); 6 statutory body (e); 7 ITA First Sch (f); 8 Societies (g);
-- 9 Co-op (h); 10 MBO (i); 11 trade union (j); 12 platform work assoc (ja);
-- 13 Public Trustee/OA (k); 14 foreign co (l); 15 company (m); 16 LLP (n);
-- 17 limited partnership (o); 18 LPA s 42(3) removes (o); 19 Minister-exempted (p);
-- 20 pre-2016 Business Registration Act proprietor (q).
GIVEN m IS A NUMBER, n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `Exemption Facts`
DECIDE ex2 m n IS
    `Exemption Facts` OF
          (m EQUALS 1 OR n EQUALS 1)
        , (m EQUALS 2 OR n EQUALS 2)
        , (m EQUALS 3 OR n EQUALS 3)
        , (m EQUALS 4 OR n EQUALS 4)
        , (m EQUALS 5 OR n EQUALS 5)
        , (m EQUALS 6 OR n EQUALS 6)
        , (m EQUALS 7 OR n EQUALS 7)
        , (m EQUALS 8 OR n EQUALS 8)
        , (m EQUALS 9 OR n EQUALS 9)
        , (m EQUALS 10 OR n EQUALS 10)
        , (m EQUALS 11 OR n EQUALS 11)
        , (m EQUALS 12 OR n EQUALS 12)
        , (m EQUALS 13 OR n EQUALS 13)
        , (m EQUALS 14 OR n EQUALS 14)
        , (m EQUALS 15 OR n EQUALS 15)
        , (m EQUALS 16 OR n EQUALS 16)
        , (m EQUALS 17 OR n EQUALS 17)
        , (m EQUALS 18 OR n EQUALS 18)
        , (m EQUALS 19 OR n EQUALS 19)
        , (m EQUALS 20 OR n EQUALS 20)

-- bp place otherwise foreign act else: Business Presence Facts in which only activity number
-- `act` (1 to 12 = s 2(3)(a) to (l); 0 = none) is TRUE.
GIVEN place IS A BOOLEAN, other IS A BOOLEAN, foreign IS A BOOLEAN, act IS A NUMBER, elsewhere IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Business Presence Facts`
DECIDE bp place other foreign act elsewhere IS
    `Business Presence Facts` OF place, other, foreign
        , act EQUALS 1
        , act EQUALS 2
        , act EQUALS 3
        , act EQUALS 4
        , act EQUALS 5
        , act EQUALS 6
        , act EQUALS 7
        , act EQUALS 8
        , act EQUALS 9
        , act EQUALS 10
        , act EQUALS 11
        , act EQUALS 12
        , elsewhere

§ `Part 1 -- ss 2 to 4`

§§ `2(1) definitions`

-- "business": trade, commerce, profession or any other activity, carried on for gain; not an office, employment or occupation.
#ASSERT `the activity is a business` (`Business Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `the activity is a business` (`Business Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is a business` (`Business Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is a business` (`Business Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE)

-- "individual": a natural person; where appropriate an executor etc. having direct control or management of the business.
#ASSERT `the person is an individual` (`Individual Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is an individual` (`Individual Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `the person is an individual` (`Individual Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT `the person is an individual` (`Individual Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is an individual` (`Individual Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE)

-- "firm": unincorporated body of 2+ individuals; 1+ individual and 1+ corporation; 2+ corporations, in partnership for profit.
#ASSERT `the body is a firm` (`Firm Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, 2, 0)
#ASSERT NOT `the body is a firm` (`Firm Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, 1, 0)
#ASSERT NOT `the body is a firm` (`Firm Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, 0, 1)
#ASSERT `the body is a firm` (`Firm Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, 1, 1)
#ASSERT `the body is a firm` (`Firm Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, 0, 2)
#ASSERT NOT `the body is a firm` (`Firm Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, 2, 0)
#ASSERT NOT `the body is a firm` (`Firm Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, 2, 0)

-- "contact address": physical address; not a PO box; same jurisdiction as residential address.
#ASSERT `the address is a contact address` (`Contact Address Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the address is a contact address` (`Contact Address Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the address is a contact address` (`Contact Address Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the address is a contact address` (`Contact Address Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE)

-- "full name": identity card name if registered under the NRA 1965, else passport name.
#ASSERT `the individual's full name` (`Full Name Facts` OF TRUE, "Tan IC", "Tan Passport") EQUALS "Tan IC"
#ASSERT `the individual's full name` (`Full Name Facts` OF FALSE, "Tan IC", "Tan Passport") EQUALS "Tan Passport"

§§ `2(2) and (3) carrying on business in Singapore`

#ASSERT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE)
-- a foreign company whose only Singapore link is a 2(3) activity is not so treated
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 1 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 2 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 3 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 4 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 5 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 6 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 7 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 8 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 9 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 10 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 11 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 12 FALSE)
-- with another reason, it is treated as carrying on business
#ASSERT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 3 TRUE)
-- a foreign company with a place of business and no 2(3) activity
#ASSERT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 0 FALSE)
-- 2(3) protects foreign companies only
#ASSERT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` (bp TRUE FALSE FALSE 3 FALSE)
#ASSERT `the foreign company does any of the activities in section 2(3)(a) to (l)` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 8 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the foreign company does any of the activities in section 2(3)(a) to (l)` (bp TRUE FALSE TRUE 0 FALSE)

