§ `Part 2 -- ss 5 to 14`

§§ `5. Requirement to register`

#ASSERT NOT `the person and the business name were registered before the person carried on business` (`Registration Requirement Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 1, 0) TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the person and the business name were registered before the person carried on business` (`Registration Requirement Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 1, 1) TRUE
#ASSERT `the person and the business name were registered before the person carried on business` (`Registration Requirement Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 1, 1) TRUE
#ASSERT `the person and the business name were registered before the person carried on business` (`Registration Requirement Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 1, 0) FALSE
#ASSERT `there is a separate registration for each business name` (`Registration Requirement Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 2, 2)
#ASSERT NOT `there is a separate registration for each business name` (`Registration Requirement Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 2, 1)
#ASSERT `there is a separate registration for each business name` (`Registration Requirement Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 1, 1)

§§ `6. Manner and particulars of registration`

ppAll MEANS `Personal Particulars` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
ppNoNat MEANS `Personal Particulars` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE
ppNoContact MEANS `Personal Particulars` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE

#ASSERT `the personal particulars are complete` ppAll
#ASSERT NOT `the personal particulars are complete` ppNoNat
#ASSERT NOT `the personal particulars are complete` ppNoContact

-- Application Facts OF kind, lodged, byAppropriate, name, nature, place, commence, indiv, corpSole, partners, corpPartners, ARs, other
appInd MEANS `Application Facts` OF `an individual proprietor`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, ppAll, FALSE, EMPTY, FALSE, EMPTY, TRUE
appIndNoNat MEANS `Application Facts` OF `an individual proprietor`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, ppNoNat, FALSE, EMPTY, FALSE, EMPTY, TRUE
appIndNoCommence MEANS `Application Facts` OF `an individual proprietor`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, ppAll, FALSE, EMPTY, FALSE, EMPTY, TRUE
appIndBadAR MEANS `Application Facts` OF `an individual proprietor`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, ppAll, FALSE, EMPTY, FALSE, (LIST ppNoContact), TRUE
appCo MEANS `Application Facts` OF `a company that is a sole proprietor`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, ppNoNat, TRUE, EMPTY, FALSE, EMPTY, TRUE
appCoNoCorp MEANS `Application Facts` OF `a company that is a sole proprietor`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, ppAll, FALSE, EMPTY, FALSE, EMPTY, TRUE
appFirm MEANS `Application Facts` OF `a firm`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, ppNoNat, FALSE, (LIST ppAll), TRUE, EMPTY, TRUE
appFirmBadPartner MEANS `Application Facts` OF `a firm`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, ppNoNat, FALSE, (LIST ppAll, ppNoNat), TRUE, EMPTY, TRUE
appNoName MEANS `Application Facts` OF `an individual proprietor`, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, ppAll, FALSE, EMPTY, FALSE, EMPTY, TRUE

#ASSERT `the application contains the particulars section 6(1)(b) requires` appInd
#ASSERT NOT `the application contains the particulars section 6(1)(b) requires` appIndNoNat
#ASSERT NOT `the application contains the particulars section 6(1)(b) requires` appIndNoCommence
#ASSERT NOT `the application contains the particulars section 6(1)(b) requires` appIndBadAR
#ASSERT NOT `the application contains the particulars section 6(1)(b) requires` appNoName
#ASSERT `the application contains the particulars section 6(1)(b) requires` appCo
#ASSERT NOT `the application contains the particulars section 6(1)(b) requires` appCoNoCorp
#ASSERT `the application contains the particulars section 6(1)(b) requires` appFirm
#ASSERT NOT `the application contains the particulars section 6(1)(b) requires` appFirmBadPartner

-- 6(3) appropriate person
#ASSERT `the person is an appropriate person` `an individual proprietor` `the individual proprietor`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is an appropriate person` `an individual proprietor` `a director or a secretary of the company`
#ASSERT `the person is an appropriate person` `a company that is a sole proprietor` `a director or a secretary of the company`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is an appropriate person` `a company that is a sole proprietor` `a manager of the limited liability partnership`
#ASSERT `the person is an appropriate person` `a limited liability partnership that is a sole proprietor` `a manager of the limited liability partnership`
#ASSERT `the person is an appropriate person` `a foreign company that is a sole proprietor` `an authorised representative of the foreign company, as section 366 of the Companies Act 1967 defines it`
#ASSERT `the person is an appropriate person` `a firm` `a partner of the firm who is an individual`
#ASSERT `the person is an appropriate person` `a firm` `a director or a secretary of a company that is a partner of the firm`
#ASSERT `the person is an appropriate person` `a firm` `a manager of a limited liability partnership that is a partner of the firm`
#ASSERT `the person is an appropriate person` `a firm` `an authorised representative of a foreign company that is a partner of the firm`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is an appropriate person` `a firm` `a director or a secretary of the company`
#ASSERT `the person is an appropriate person` `a firm` `a registered corporate service provider authorised by and acting for the person`
#ASSERT `the person is an appropriate person` `an individual proprietor` `a registered corporate service provider authorised by and acting for the person`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is an appropriate person` `a firm` `someone else`
#ASSERT `the application is properly lodged` appInd `the individual proprietor`
#ASSERT NOT `the application is properly lodged` appInd `someone else`

§§ `7. Nominee or trustee`

#ASSERT `the nominee or trustee has provided the particulars section 7(1) requires` (`Nominee Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the nominee or trustee has provided the particulars section 7(1) requires` (`Nominee Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the nominee or trustee has provided the particulars section 7(1) requires` (`Nominee Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `the person contravenes section 7(2)` (`Nominee Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person contravenes section 7(2)` (`Nominee Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person contravenes section 7(2)` (`Nominee Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE)

§§ `8 and 9. Registration and refusal`

-- Registration Decision Facts OF received, satisfied, unlawful, natsec, foreign, foreignRegistered, name17, ministerConsent
#ASSERT `the Registrar's duty on an application for registration` (`Registration Decision Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `the Registrar must register the applicant and the business name and issue a notice of registration`
#ASSERT `the Registrar's duty on an application for registration` (`Registration Decision Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `there is no application to decide`
#ASSERT `the Registrar's duty on an application for registration` (`Registration Decision Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `the Registrar must refuse to register`
#ASSERT `the Registrar's duty on an application for registration` (`Registration Decision Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `the Registrar must refuse to register`
#ASSERT `the Registrar's duty on an application for registration` (`Registration Decision Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `the Registrar must refuse to register`
#ASSERT `the Registrar's duty on an application for registration` (`Registration Decision Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `the Registrar must register the applicant and the business name and issue a notice of registration`
#ASSERT `the Registrar's duty on an application for registration` (`Registration Decision Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS `the Registrar must refuse to register`
#ASSERT `the Registrar's duty on an application for registration` (`Registration Decision Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS `the Registrar must register the applicant and the business name and issue a notice of registration`
#ASSERT `the Registrar's duty on an application for registration` (`Registration Decision Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `the Registrar is not required to register`
-- s 9 "despite any provision": a ground for refusal wins over dissatisfaction with the particulars
#ASSERT `the Registrar's duty on an application for registration` (`Registration Decision Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `the Registrar must refuse to register`

-- 8(2) certificate
#ASSERT `the Registrar may issue a certificate of confirmation of registration` (`Certificate Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may issue a certificate of confirmation of registration` (`Certificate Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may issue a certificate of confirmation of registration` (`Certificate Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may issue a certificate of confirmation of registration` (`Certificate Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE)

-- 8(3) to (5) renewal: Renewal Facts OF lodged, fee, required, provided, satisfied
#ASSERT `the registration is renewable` (`Renewal Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT `the registration is renewable` (`Renewal Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the registration is renewable` (`Renewal Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the registration is renewable` (`Renewal Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the registration is renewable` (`Renewal Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the registration is renewable` (`Renewal Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `the Registrar may refuse to renew because additional particulars were not provided` (`Renewal Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may refuse to renew because additional particulars were not provided` (`Renewal Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT `the Registrar is not required to renew the registration` (`Renewal Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)

-- 8(6), 10(1), 10(2)
#ASSERT NOT `registration or renewal implies that the person has complied with the law relating to the business`
#ASSERT NOT `registration confers property in the registered business name or in a word in it`
#ASSERT NOT `registration is evidence that the person owns property or a right or interest in property used for the business`

-- 8(7): appeal within 30 days.  Appeal Facts OF aggrieved, notified, appealed, extended, excludedByCertificate
