§§ `11. Authorised representative`

#ASSERT `the person resides outside Singapore` (`Residence Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person resides outside Singapore` (`Residence Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT `the person resides outside Singapore` (`Residence Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person resides outside Singapore` (`Residence Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)

outsider MEANS `Residence Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
insider MEANS `Residence Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
foreignCo MEANS `Residence Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE

#ASSERT `an authorised representative must be appointed` (`Representative Requirement Facts` OF `an individual proprietor`, LIST outsider)
#ASSERT NOT `an authorised representative must be appointed` (`Representative Requirement Facts` OF `an individual proprietor`, LIST insider)
#ASSERT `an authorised representative must be appointed` (`Representative Requirement Facts` OF `a firm`, LIST outsider, outsider)
