#ASSERT NOT `an authorised representative must be appointed` (`Representative Requirement Facts` OF `a foreign company that is a sole proprietor`, LIST foreignCo, insider)
-- s 11(1) names only an individual proprietor, a firm and a foreign company
#ASSERT NOT `an authorised representative must be appointed` (`Representative Requirement Facts` OF `a company that is a sole proprietor`, LIST foreignCo)

-- 11(2)
